# --- Participant data: never commit (privacy) ---
# Everything recorded or derived from recordings stays out of git: audio, video,
# transcripts, and the tables/arrays built from them (embeddings, UMAPs). The
# rules above already cover *.wav, *.mp3, *.ogg, *.m4a, *.flac, *.csv, *.json
# and *.zip. Analysis code reads this data from outside the repo (analysis/scripts/paths.py).
*.aac
*.aiff
*.opus
*.wma
*.webm
*.mp4
*.mov
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.parquet
*.feather
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.npz
*.npy
*.pt
*.h5
*.srt
*.vtt
*.txt
!requirements*.txt
!robots.txt
analysis/data/

# ignore data dir
data/**
